# Blackshear PTA — response headers for Cloudflare Workers static assets.
#
# noindex applies to the WHOLE SITE and must stay until cutover (TASKS.md A6).
# Until Weebly is retired it is the canonical site; letting Google index a
# second full copy of the same content on a new domain is a ranking mess to
# unwind later. Remove this block as part of the cutover, not before.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
